  "Too few turns between the runs: {a} left, {b} right, {c} needed each way.": "Zu wenig Drehungen zwischen den Strecken: {a} links, {b} rechts, je Richtung {c} nötig.",
  "Too few turns on the spot: {a} rounds left, {b} right, {c} needed each way (in two turns at least).": "Zu wenig Drehungen auf der Stelle: {a} Runden links, {b} rechts, je Richtung {c} nötig (in mindestens zwei Drehungen).",
  "Too little standing still: {a} of {b} s.": "Zu wenig gestanden: {a} von {b} s.",
